{"title":"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A ski lift carries a skier at a rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> km per hour. How many kilometres does the ski lift carry the skier in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/9/f59b149943de174ee3b9465ae86575564d9f1224.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 120 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 1.2 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 2.4 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 1.67$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"458\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes in an hour, so the ski lift carries a skier at a rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> km per <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes. Thus, in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/6/1e60a1efab9107d673561b737e264b75854d1068.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{60}{6} = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"66\" height=\"38\" /> minutes, the ski left carries the skier <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f9805815b2cac09c3c042ca22d8371ad9d274d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12}{6} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"104\" height=\"38\" /> km.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&